<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="api_irtcengine_updatertmptranscoding">
    <title><ph keyref="updateRtmpTranscoding"/></title>
    <shortdesc id="short"><ph id="shortdesc" props="cpp">Updates the transcoding configuration for CDN streaming.</ph><ph id="shortdesc" props="android">Updates the transcoding configuration for live streaming.</ph><ph id="shortdesc" props="ios mac">Updates the transcoding configuration.</ph></shortdesc>
    <prolog>
        <metadata>
            <keywords>
                <indexterm keyref="updateRtmpTranscoding"/>
            </keywords>
        </metadata>
    </prolog>
    <refbody>
        <section id="prototype">
            <p outputclass="codeblock">
                <codeblock props="cpp" outputclass="language-cpp">virtual int updateRtmpTranscoding(const LiveTranscoding&amp; transcoding) = 0;</codeblock>
                <codeblock props="android" outputclass="language-java">public abstract int updateRtmpTranscoding(LiveTranscoding transcoding);</codeblock>
            <codeblock props="ios mac" outputclass="language-objectivec">- (int)updateRtmpTranscoding:(AgoraLiveTranscoding* _Nullable)transcoding;</codeblock>
            <codeblock props="ios" outputclass="language-objectivec">- (int)updateRtmpTranscoding:(AgoraLiveTranscoding* _Nullable)transcoding NS_SWIFT_NAME(updateRtmpTranscoding(_:));</codeblock>
                </p>
        </section>
        <section id="detailed_desc" deliveryTarget="details" otherprops="no-title">
            <p props="cpp">Agora recommends using a more comprehensive server-side streaming feature. See [Implement server-side CDN streaming](https://doc.shengwang.cn/doc/media-push/restful/landing-page).
After starting to push media streams to CDN with transcoding, you can dynamically update the transcoding configuration based on actual scenarios. After updating the configuration, the SDK triggers the <xref keyref="onTranscodingUpdated"/> callback.</p>
            <p props="android">Agora recommends using a more complete server-side streaming solution. See [Implement server-side live streaming](https://doc.shengwang.cn/doc/media-push/restful/landing-page).</p>
        <p props="ios mac">Agora recommends that you use the server-side Media Push function. For details, see <xref keyref="cdn-streaming-restful">Use RESTful API</xref>.</p>
            <p props="ios mac">After you start pushing media streams to CDN with transcoding, you can dynamically update the transcoding configuration according to the scenario. The SDK triggers the <xref keyref="onTranscodingUpdated"/> callback after the transcoding configuration is updated.</p>
        </section>
        <section id="parameters" deliveryTarget="details" props="android cpp ios mac">
            <title>Parameters</title>
            <parml>
                <plentry props="cpp">
                    <pt>transcoding</pt>
                    <pd>Transcoding configuration for CDN streaming. See <xref keyref="LiveTranscoding"/>.</pd>
                </plentry>
                <plentry props="android">
                    <pt>transcoding</pt>
                    <pd>The transcoding configuration for live streaming. See <xref keyref="LiveTranscoding"/>.</pd>
                </plentry>
            <plentry conkeyref="startRtmpStreamWithTranscoding/transcoding" props="ios mac">
                <pt/>
                <pd/>
            </plentry>
            </parml>
        </section>
        <section id="return_values" props="android cpp ios mac">
            <title>Return Values</title>
            <p props="cpp">
                <ul>
                    <li>0: Success.</li>
                    <li>&lt; 0: Failure.</li>
                </ul>
            </p>
            <p props="android">
                <ul>
                    <li>0: Success.</li>
                    <li>&lt; 0: Failure.</li>
                </ul>
            </p>
        <ul props="ios mac">
            <li>0: Success.</li>
            <li>&lt; 0: Failure. <ph props="cn">See <xref keyref="error-code-link"/> for details and resolution suggestions.</ph></li>
            </ul> </section>
    </refbody>
</reference>
